## Privacy first

- **One installation = one firm.** Data remains on your server (mailbox, Nextcloud, local database).
- **Local AI by default.** An external AI is activated only with your explicit consent, and all outgoing text is
  pseudonymized.
- **No data is transmitted to the software author.** No telemetry.
- The screenshots in this document use **fictitious data** only.

Details: [docs/PRIVACY.md](docs/PRIVACY.md).

